Package: devjam-pipewire-scripts
Version: 1.3-1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: systemd, libnotify-bin
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Scripts to switch between PipeWire and ALSA-only mode
 Menu entries and scripts to stop PipeWire and let ALSA clients use the
 sound card directly, and to switch back:
 .
  switch2alsa                 ALSA only until the next logout/reboot
  switch2pipewire             undo switch2alsa
  switch2alsa-persistent      ALSA only, also after logout/reboot
  switch2pipewire-persistent  undo switch2alsa-persistent
  pipewire-restart            restart PipeWire, WirePlumber and pipewire-pulse
 .
 The modes are per user. In ALSA-only mode the ALSA "default" device is
 routed to the sound card instead of PipeWire through
 /etc/alsa/conf.d/99z-devjam-alsa-only.conf.
